{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初心雖知中道，是但中理不具諸法，不同涅槃佛性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此四句出集論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十信\n析空，十住體空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩雖未證空，亦得修空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若登初地後，則與圓慈同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T85n2778_p0522c15"}
